<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HALLE, Germany 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at the $875,000 German grass-court men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Thomas Haas (Germany) beat Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat Jim Grabb (U.S.) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>4-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Alexander Radulescu (Germany) 6-3 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 6-0  6-2  </p>
<p>Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Karsten Braasch (Germany) 6-1 6-7 (10-12) 6-3</p>
</text>
